    "text": "Hints : $(3,5)$ lies outside the ellipse $3 x^2+5 y^2=32$ and on the ellipse $25 x^2+9 y^2=450$. Therefore there will be 2 tangents for the first ellipse and one tangent for the second ellipse.",
